flowchart TD
    Req([Engine produces<br/>candidate output]) --> Count{Count declarative<br/>sentences in output}
    Count -->|>= 3| No1[BLOCKED]
    Count -->|< 3| Words{Word count of output}
    Words -->|> 60 words| No2[BLOCKED]
    Words -->|<= 60 words| Type{Output type?}
    Type -->|Direct prose paragraph<br/>answering the user| No3[BLOCKED]
    Type -->|Socratic question| Yes1[ALLOWED]
